<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-phase-3-balanced-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This set retains the 4pc Protection Tier Set Bonus, the performance of the bonus is highly dependent on finding cases to exploit its interaction. Trinket slots are highly flexible and should be used to react to circumstances: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96927/soul-barrier">
<img alt="Soul Barrier" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_warlock_demonsoul.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Barrier</span></a> can be swapped to an offensive trinket such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96770/spark-of-zandalar">
<img alt="Spark of Zandalar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_lightningshield.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spark of Zandalar</span></a>, and subbing in a second defensive trinket such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96793/fortitude-of-the-zandalari">
<img alt="Fortitude of the Zandalari" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_mindvision.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fortitude of the Zandalari</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=91210/tyrannical-gladiators-emblem-of-tenacity">
<img alt="Tyrannical Gladiator's Emblem of Tenacity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_endlessrage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tyrannical Gladiator's Emblem of Tenacity</span></a> can provide a cheeky additional cooldown at a relatively low cost without hurting any of your caps. Despite picking up a lot of damage-oriented items the set is very tanky due to conservative reforges and enchants, but the majority of those items can be re-used for more damage oriented setups once content is on farm.<br/>
