<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-phase-3-offensive-bis" role="tabpanel" style="display: none;" tabindex="0">Compared to the more conservative balanced gearset, this list forsakes the use of the tier set and reforges and gems very offensively. Overall, you can expect an about 15% damage increase compared to the balanced version, while sacrificing about 40% of your survivability in the process. However, keep in mind that there may still be many encounters where you would rather run the Protection 4pc bonus instead, which requires reforging to run without overcapping hit.<br/>
