<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Protection Paladins in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The Tier 15 Protection Tier set bonuses are interesting and, given the right circumstance, very powerful. The 2-piece bonus excels when you're already otherwise compelled to use <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=114163/eternal-flame">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_torch_thrown.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eternal Flame</span></a>, providing a very solid damage reduction for the next 15 seconds. However, the main draw of the set lies in its 4-piece bonus. Even at its most basic usage it's already quite good, almost fully offsetting the bad secondary stats. The bonus shines particularly brightly when encounters present burst sequences or otherwise exploitable constant damage sources, which aren't dangerous, but provide a constant source of extra Holy Power.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-15-tank">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 15 Protection - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1164/plate-of-the-lightning-emperor">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Plate of the Lightning Emperor</span></a></span></h3>
